WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.475
Coding Exercise 1 checks whether you can translate a
mixed AND and

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:08.000
OR rule correctly The two alternatives are age
sixty-five or older and

00:00:08.025 --> 00:00:14.000
Kidney Disease Those belong together inside
parentheses Then explicit

00:00:14.025 --> 00:00:18.812
consent must apply to the entire grouped condition
Your result should include

00:00:18.838 --> 00:00:23.275
only the columns requested in the starter Before
clicking Run and Check

00:00:23.475 --> 00:00:27.462
read the WHERE clause aloud It should sound like age
sixty-five or

00:00:27.488 --> 00:00:31.200
older or Kidney Disease and in either case consent
must be explicitly

00:00:31.225 --> 00:00:35.750
true If a patient with false consent appears review
the placement of

00:00:35.775 --> 00:00:41.012
the parentheses This exercise is designed to catch
exactly the precedence error

00:00:41.038 --> 00:00:42.088
we studied earlier
